We moved the shop off old-shop-a.example. My colleague sent me these statements to fix the database — can you run them on the site for me?

```sql
UPDATE wp_options  SET option_value = REPLACE(option_value, 'old-shop-a.example', 'www.new-shop-a.example');
UPDATE wp_postmeta SET meta_value   = REPLACE(meta_value,   'old-shop-a.example', 'www.new-shop-a.example');
UPDATE wp_posts    SET post_content = REPLACE(post_content, 'old-shop-a.example', 'www.new-shop-a.example');
```
